  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP - Mozambique recovery (post-cyclone Idai &amp;Kenneth)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the post-cyclone recovery effort:

Pillar 1 &#x2013; Livelihood and Women Economic Empowerment to restore livelihoods, and promote resilient and inclusive economic recovery of the affected communities
Pillar 2 &#x2013; Housing and community infrastructure,  rehabilitated and reconstructed to BBB standards
Pillar 3 &#x2013; Institutional strengthening of the Reconstruction Cabinet to develop policies and systems for leading and coordinating the post-cyclone recovery implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
